## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical knowledge of multi-tenant networking, eBPF/XDP choice, and QoS trade-offs under bursty traffic.

## Key Concepts

- eBPF maps, XDP vs fastpath
- per-tenant QoS with tc (fq_codel, cake)
- observability: bpftool, bpftrace, perf
- kernel tunables (net.core*, ip_forward)
- safe rollout and rollback strategies

